  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_absin",
      "name": {
        "en": "Absinthe's Badge",
        "zh": "苦艾证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_absin",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Absinthe has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for inflicting Arts casualties on the enemy.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Caster Operator during field operations to exercise Core Caster responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员苦艾擅长对敌人造成法术杀伤\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为术师干员，行使中坚术师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_absin",
      "name": {
        "en": "'Custodia' Individual Comm-Unit",
        "zh": "“监护者”单兵通讯单元",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_absin",
      "description": {
        "en": "During the siege and looting carried out by the Reunion Movement, Operator Absinthe tried several times to contact the garrison outside the city for support. She also attempted to call her father, whose whereabouts were unknown, but never received a response, only the murmur of pale despair. It was like holding a candle in the dark, unable to see the way forward or find the way back, but still persistently believing in the false, icy hope she gripped.\nAccording to Operator Absinthe's recollection, she thought she heard her father's voice from her communication device just as she was about to fall unconscious. She sprung up in surprise and luckily avoided Reunion forces passing by. However, the message was too short for her to even confirm whether it was a real voice or a hallucination brought on by fear, hunger, and despair.\n\nAfter coming to Rhodes Island, Operator Absinthe persists in attempting to contact her father through the communication device when there is no one around, as if he is silently listening to the other end.\n'Dad, are you there? They took me to a place called Rhodes Island. They say it's safe here... I hope it's true.'\n'Dinner was tough today, but I still ate a lot.'\n'I started training at Rhodes Island, with Instructor Dobermann... Err, she's my teacher. She says I'm doing well, but... I know she's just encouraging me to keep going...'\n'I'm going on missions with other operators here soon, but I don't know how well I'll do...'\n'I noticed my pants looked short today. I think I'm getting taller, Dad.'\n'Dad, are you listening...?'\n...\n\n'Regarding the phenomenon of hearing her father's voice from the communication device, Operator Absinthe comes close to bringing it up to the medical operators during her psychological treatments. With different memory fragments overlapping and pieced together, and according to information collected later in Chernobog, our assessment is that this communication may have really occurred, but it very likely did not come from Absinthe's father's comm. Rather, it was a Reunion transmission. When the mob located and assaulted the location where the remaining civilian police officers had taken refuge, Absinthe's father's voice was picked up in the ensuing chaos.'\n'As for why an Ursus police communicator received a Reunion signal, the most likely explanation is channel interference, calling for no further inquiry.'\n'The above medical record will be expunged today.'",
        "zh": "苦艾干员本人在躲避整合运动的封锁与搜捕的时候，曾数次试图联系城外驻军寻求支援，也无数次试图呼叫不知在何处的父亲，但从未得到过任何回应，只有苍白绝望的杂音。就像在黑暗中手握着一支烛光摇曳微弱的蜡烛，看不清前路，也找不到来路，却依旧执着地相信着手上虚假而冰冷的希望。\n根据苦艾干员本人的回忆，她在即将陷入昏迷的一瞬间，似乎曾从通讯装置内听到了父亲的声音，从而惊醒过来并幸运地躲开了恰好路过的整合运动。但那一刻的讯息太短，以至于她自己都无法确定那到底是真实的声音，还是自己在饥饿、恐惧和绝望中出现的幻想。\n\n而在来到罗德岛以后，苦艾干员时常会在无人的时候，用通讯器保持和父亲的通话，仿佛他就在另一边静静地听着。\n“父亲，你在吗？我现在被带到了一个叫罗德岛的地方。他们和我说这里很安全……希望是这样。”\n“今天的晚饭有点硬，但我还是吃了好多。”\n“我已经在罗德岛上开始接受训练，杜宾老师……啊，就是我现在的教官。她说我已经做得很好，但是……我知道她只是在安慰和鼓励我……”\n“我之后会跟这里其他的干员一起出任务，但我不知道自己能不做好……”\n“今天发现裤子有点短了，我好像长高了一点呢，父亲。”\n“父亲，你在听吗……”\n……\n\n“对于曾在通讯装置中听到父亲声音这件事，苦艾干员几乎在每一次心理治疗时都会向医疗干员提及。随着不同的记忆碎片不断被叠加拼凑，并根据后来在切尔诺伯格所搜集到的各项情报，我们的综合判断是这则通讯应该是真实发生过的，但是极有可能不是来自苦艾父亲的通讯装置，而是来自整合运动。当暴徒找到并冲入幸存平民警察的避难所时，在一片混乱中意外收入了苦艾父亲的声音。”\n“对于为什么乌萨斯军警的通讯装置会接收到整合运动的讯号，姑且解释为通讯装置的频道互串，并不是一件奇怪的事情，不再深究。”\n“上述医疗记录应于当日进行销毁。”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
